{29}{[He studies you for a moment, then nods.]  I recken ya ain't such a bad feller after all.  I mean, if I'd known yer were so civilized, I wouldn't never have spoken like that.}{[He studies you for a moment, then nods.]  I recken ya ain't such a bad lady after all.  I mean, if I'd known yer were so civilized, I wouldn't never have spoken like that.}{}{}{}{}
