{42}{Where is inn?}{}{-4}{}{98}{}
{43}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{55}{Of course, everbody wants to hear about him. That's Ol' Bany. His real name was Alba, or Ala -sumthin'-sumthin'-bany. He owned the tavern over there and was sumthin' of a mage as well. This was a couple years ago. Back then, this place didn't even have a name, it was just a wide spot along the road. Well, anyways, sum high an' mighty dandy named Lord Rowan Fane built a fancy huntin' lodge a few miles up the road an' started killin' off ever critter he an' his friends could find.}{Of course, everbody wants to hear about him. That's Ol' Bany. His real name was Alba, or Ala -sumthin'-sumthin'-bany. He owned the tavern over there and was sumthin' of a mage as well. This was a couple years ago. Back then, this place didn't even have a name, it was just a wide spot along the road. Well, anyways, sum high an' mighty dandy named Lord Rowan Fane built a fancy huntin' lodge a few miles up the road an' started killin' off ever critter he an' his friends could find.}{}{}{}{}
{56}{And....?}{}{5}{}{65}{}
{57}{On second thought, some other time perhaps.}{}{5}{}{104}{}
{59}{Yuh...?}{}{-4}{}{65}{}
{60}{Not today. Maybee later.}{}{-4}{}{104}{}
{62}{K:}{}{1}{}{38}{}
{63}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{65}{Well, one day Ol' Bany figgered he'd had just about enough a that, an' went up there an' demanded that Lord Fane stop that. Sumtin' about all that killin' bein' bad for the forest spirits an' such. As ya might guess, Lord Fane just laughed at him an' had Bany thrown out. Well, Ol' Bany worked himself up a powerful spell and put a curse on the whole place an' everthin' in it.}{Well, one day Ol' Bany figgered he'd had just about enough a that, an' went up there an' demanded that Lord Fane stop that. Sumtin' about all that killin' bein' bad for the forest spirits an' such. As ya might guess, Lord Fane just laughed at him an' had Bany thrown out. Well, Ol' Bany worked himself up a powerful spell and put a curse on the whole place an' everthin' in it.}{}{}{}{}
{66}{I see..... Go on....}{}{5}{}{75}{}
{68}{Oh... Go on...}{}{-4}{}{75}{}
{75}{Well, now, le' me tell ya! Ol' Bany sure made the punishment fit the crime! Ya see, he brought back the spirits of all the critters Lord Fane and his cronies had killed and let em' loose in the lodge. Those rich city folk didn't stand a chance against all those wild ghosties. They all got killed real quick and became ghosts themselves. Bany figgered on lettin' them suffer for a day or so, then undoin' the spell.}{Well, now, le' me tell ya! Ol' Bany sure made the punishment fit the crime! Ya see, he brought back the spirits of all the critters Lord Fane and his cronies had killed and let em' loose in the lodge. Those rich city folk didn't stand a chance against all those wild ghosties. They all got killed real quick and became ghosts themselves. Bany figgered on lettin' them suffer for a day or so, then undoin' the spell.}{}{}{}{}
{76}{I hear a "but" coming...}{}{5}{}{80}{}
{77}{Uhh.. I hear a "but" comin'....}{}{-4}{}{80}{}
{80}{Ya heared right. When Bany came back to town, he was tellin' us about what he'd done when he got jumped by a couple guys who'd been on their way up to the lodge. More friends of the Lord, they were. They had guns an' such, an' we couldn't even lift a finger as they dragged Ol' Bany over to the tree and strung him up with some chain. Took poor Bany all night to die.}{Ya heared right. When Bany came back to town, he was tellin' us about what he'd done when he got jumped by a couple guys who'd been on their way up to the lodge. More friends of the Lord, they were. They had guns an' such, an' we couldn't even lift a finger as they dragged Ol' Bany over to the tree and strung him up with some chain. Took poor Bany all night to die.}{}{}{}{}
{81}{And then?}{}{5}{}{84}{}
{82}{So...?}{}{-4}{}{84}{}
{84}{After those guys left, Charlie, the blacksmith tried to cut him down, but couldn't get the chain loose or even cut it. Then Tomaus and Agatha; they run the magic shop; tried to ressurect Bany, but that didn't do any good either. I dunno, maybe the chain was cursed. So, there was nothin' we could do but leave him there. Funny thing is, he never rotted but just kinda petrified. Wierd. }{After those guys left, Charlie, the blacksmith tried to cut him down, but couldn't get the chain loose or even cut it. Then Tomaus and Agatha; they run the magic shop; tried to ressurect Bany, but that didn't do any good either. I dunno, maybe the chain was cursed. So, there was nothin' we could do but leave him there. Funny thing is, he never rotted but just kinda petrified. Wierd. }{}{}{}{}
{85}{Wierd is right. Please, continue.}{}{5}{}{87}{}
{86}{Yuh. Weird. Tell me more.}{}{-4}{}{87}{}
{87}{Well, a few months later, we heard tell that directions to Stillwater included " go up the road untill ya come ta where they lynched Bany and turn right".  After that, we started calling our town Lynchbany. As for all the ghosts, well, they're still up there and mean as ever. All of them! Whatever ya do, don't go near that place. [He shudders] }{Well, a few months later, we heard tell that directions to Stillwater included " go up the road untill ya come ta where they lynched Bany and turn right".  After that, we started calling our town Lynchbany. As for all the ghosts, well, they're still up there and mean as ever. All of them! Whatever ya do, don't go near that place. [He shudders] }{}{}{}{}
{88}{Would you mark it's location on my map? Just so I know.}{}{5}{}{90}{}
{89}{You show me where lodge is at?}{}{-4}{}{90}{}
{90}{[He looks at you for a moment, then shrugs] Sure. It's right here. But when ya get yurself killed, don't say I didn't warn ya.}{[He looks at you for a moment, then shrugs] Sure. It's right here. But when ya get yurself killed, don't say I didn't warn ya.}{}{}{}{mm114, ru 2219}
